   "text": "(PPE) likely • Test for HIV 124. • If lesions in webspaces, axillae or genitals, also treat for scabies in adjacent column. • Apply hydrocortisone 1% cream twice a day for 7 days (apply sparingly to face, avoid eyes) • For itch, give cetirizine 10mg daily. • Advise patient: - Reduce exposure to",
