   "text": "1History of anaphylaxis, urticaria or angioedema. 2Common triggers: foods (milk, eggs, nuts, wheat, seafood), medications, insect bites/stings and latex. 3Wheeze, difficulty breathing, dizziness/collapse, abdominal pain, vomiting.",
